==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] (30) should be more than enough to beat this stage and all of the ones before it. If you're not confident, you can bring some attack up combos. [[Brave Cutter (Combo)|Brave Cutter]] is a good cat combo to bring because you can stall the first [[Dagshund]] with [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]] while making money for [[Awakened Bahamut Cat|Bahamut]], though it's not needed since the low strength magnifications in this stage lets [[Awakened Bahamut Cat|Bahamut]] kill everything in one hit.

